{
  "info": {
    "name": "Grana Tracker API",
    "_postman_id": "f7d1e0b2-9b48-4f0b-8c2e-1a2b3c4d5e6f",
    "description": "Sprint 2 API: auth, user, portfolios, and investments (1:N).\n\n## Como usar\n1. Selecione o environment **Grana Tracker - Local** (ou só use as variáveis da collection)\n2. Rode **Auth > Register** uma vez para criar um usuário (o token cai automaticamente em `{{accessToken}}`)\n3. Rode **Portfolios > Create portfolio** — o id cai em `{{portfolioId}}`\n4. Rode **Investments > Create investment in portfolio** — o id cai em `{{investmentId}}`\n5. Rode **Portfolios > Get portfolio (nested)** — esse é o endpoint 1:N que entrega a sprint\n\nA partir daí qualquer endpoint pode ser executado em qualquer ordem.\n\nSe o access token expirar (15 min), rode **Auth > Refresh token**.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [
      { "key": "token", "value": "{{accessToken}}", "type": "string" }
    ]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:8080", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "accessToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "refreshToken", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "portfolioId", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "investmentId", "value": "", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Liveness (/healthz)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/healthz",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["healthz"]
            },
            "description": "Liveness probe — sempre 200 se o processo está vivo."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Readiness (/readyz)",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/readyz",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["readyz"]
            },
            "description": "Readiness probe — 200 se o DB está alcançável, 503 caso contrário."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Register",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.access_token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refresh_token);",
                  "  console.log('Tokens salvos. accessToken length =', data.access_token.length);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('Register falhou:', pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Demo User\",\n  \"email\": \"demo@grana.com\",\n  \"password\": \"senha123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "register"]
            },
            "description": "Cria um usuário e devolve `access_token` + `refresh_token`. Os dois são salvos automaticamente em variáveis da collection."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.access_token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refresh_token);",
                  "  console.log('Login OK — tokens atualizados');",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('Login falhou:', pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"demo@grana.com\",\n  \"password\": \"senha123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Valida email/senha e devolve um novo par de tokens. Salva ambos automaticamente."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Refresh token",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('accessToken', data.access_token);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('refreshToken', data.refresh_token);",
                  "  console.log('Tokens renovados');",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"refresh_token\": \"{{refreshToken}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/refresh",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "auth", "refresh"]
            },
            "description": "Troca um refresh_token válido (7d) por um novo par de tokens. Use quando o access expira (15 min)."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
