    {
      "name": "Portfolios",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "List portfolios",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/portfolios",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "portfolios"]
            },
            "description": "Lista os portfólios do usuário autenticado (sem investimentos aninhados — para isso use o **Get portfolio (nested)**)."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Create portfolio",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('portfolioId', data.id);",
                  "  console.log('portfolioId salvo:', data.id);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('Create falhou:', pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Cripto Longo Prazo\",\n  \"type\": \"simulated\",\n  \"description\": \"Carteira simulada para testar estratégias\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/portfolios",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "portfolios"]
            },
            "description": "Cria um portfólio. `type` deve ser `real` ou `simulated`. O id retornado é salvo automaticamente em `{{portfolioId}}`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get portfolio (nested) — endpoint 1:N",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/portfolios/{{portfolioId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "portfolios", "{{portfolioId}}"]
            },
            "description": "🔥 **Endpoint principal da Sprint 2.**\n\nRetorna o portfólio com seus investimentos aninhados em um único request:\n\n```json\n{\n  \"data\": {\n    \"id\": \"...\",\n    \"name\": \"...\",\n    \"type\": \"simulated\",\n    \"investments\": [\n      { \"id\": \"...\", \"ticker\": \"BTC\", ... },\n      { \"id\": \"...\", \"ticker\": \"ETH\", ... }\n    ]\n  }\n}\n```\n\nOrdenado por `purchase_date DESC, created_at DESC`."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Update portfolio",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Cripto Renomeado\",\n  \"description\": \"Atualizada via Postman\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/portfolios/{{portfolioId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "portfolios", "{{portfolioId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Atualização parcial — passe só os campos que quiser mudar."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Delete portfolio (cascades to investments)",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/portfolios/{{portfolioId}}",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "portfolios", "{{portfolioId}}"]
            },
            "description": "Deleta o portfólio. Por `ON DELETE CASCADE` no schema, todos os investimentos dele somem junto."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Investments",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Create investment in portfolio",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "  const data = pm.response.json().data;",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('investmentId', data.id);",
                  "  console.log('investmentId salvo:', data.id);",
                  "} else {",
                  "  console.log('Create falhou:', pm.response.text());",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"ticker\": \"BTC\",\n  \"asset_type\": \"crypto\",\n  \"amount_invested\": \"5000.00\",\n  \"quantity\": \"0.05\",\n  \"purchase_date\": \"2025-02-15\",\n  \"notes\": \"Compra de exemplo\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/portfolios/{{portfolioId}}/investments",
              "host": ["{{baseUrl}}"],
              "path": ["api", "portfolios", "{{portfolioId}}", "investments"]
            },
            "description": "Adiciona um investimento a um portfólio existente.\n\n**Validações:**\n- `ticker` obrigatório\n- `asset_type` deve ser `stock`, `crypto`, `etf` ou `index`\n- `amount_invested` decimal como string (ex: `\"1234.56\"`)\n- `quantity` opcional, decimal como string\n- `purchase_date` no formato `YYYY-MM-DD`\n- `notes` opcional\n\nValores monetários são DECIMAL no Postgres — nunca float."
          },
          "response": []
        },
